# Late-refusal records, never repo content. scripts/snap-contrast.mjs defaults its OUTDIR
# to output-proof/contrast/ (a TRACKED directory) when produce.mjs does not thread one — a
# disclosed gap, CLAUDE.md follow-up #8 — so a real failing run appends its refusal record
# inside the repo. Ignored here so it cannot be committed by accident while the gap is open.
output-proof/**/late-refusals.jsonl

# The dark-basemap guard's debug screenshot. It USED to be written into the produce outDir,
# which is the delivery — a "static" form then held two image files and the run was refused.
# It now lands here, on snap-theme.mjs's own default, and this directory is not repo content:
# a byproduct a human can open, not an artifact anyone reviews in a diff.
output-proof/theme/
